<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 380 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 380 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 200 million zlotys of 91-day NBP bills with an average yield of 21.99 percent, down 0.01 from the last auction, after Polish banks bid for 300 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It also sold 180 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills with a flat average yield of 22.00 percent after investors bid for 180 million.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
